OL,3,AItalian foreign minister says hackers
OL,4,Aleaked his personal data
OL,5,
OL,6,FItaly's Foreign Minister Antonio Tajani
OL,7,Fsays he has been targeted by
OL,8,F"cyber-criminals" who published his
OL,9,Fpersonal data online because of his
OL,10,Fcountry's support for Ukraine.
OL,12,F"For days now, cyber-criminals have
OL,13,Fbeen publishing my personal data on the
OL,14,Fdark web and seeking further
OL,15,Finformation, effectively exposing me to
OL,16,Fnew threats and intimidation," Tajani
OL,17,Fwrote on X.
OL,19,FHe did not specify the nature of the
OL,20,Fthreats, but said the hackers were also
OL,21,Ftargeting his family.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
